EcruteakCity_Cave1_Text_Man_1::
	.string "MORTY: Hey, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Long time no see.\p"
	.string "I was just investigating a little\n"
	.string "because I heard the legendary\l"
	.string "beasts were inside the tower.\p"
	.string "By the way, congratulations on\n"
	.string "becoming the CHAMPION of JOHTO!\p"
	.string "I heard you were going to KANTO, so\n"
	.string "why did you return so early?$"

EcruteakCity_Cave1_Text_Man_2::
	.string "Oh, really? You got a\n"
	.string "GHOSTBUSTER?\p"
	.string "Yeah, I remember having one some\n"
	.string "time ago.\p"
	.string "I even managed to make it work\n"
	.string "properly.\p"
	.string "I see, so you want me to make your\n"
	.string "GHOSTBUSTER work?\l"
	.string "Is that right?$"

EcruteakCity_Cave1_Text_Man_3::
	.string "OK, I will be here if you need me.$"

EcruteakCity_Cave1_Text_Man_4::
	.string "Don’t worry about me.\n"
	.string "I will go back to the GYM soon.$"

EcruteakCity_Cave1_Text_Man_5::
	.string "So, you want me to make your\n"
	.string "GHOSTBUSTER work?$"

EcruteakCity_Cave1_Text_Man_6::
	.string "All right. But you know what?\n"
	.string "I’ve been training a lot since you\l"
	.string "defeated me.\p"
	.string "What do you say about a little\n"
	.string "rematch?\p"
	.string "I wanted to know what feels to battle\n"
	.string "against you.\l"
	.string "Against JOHTO’s CHAMPION!$"

EcruteakCity_Cave1_Text_ManDefeat::
	.string "Wow. Awesome battle!$"

EcruteakCity_Cave1_Text_ManVictory::
	.string "Hmmm...\n"
	.string "Seems like I improved a lot.$"

EcruteakCity_Cave1_Text_Man_7::
	.string "MORTY: You truly became powerful,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}.\l"
	.string "I was no match at all.\p"
	.string "Well, as I promised, I’ll fix your\n"
	.string "GHOSTBUSTER, so it will be able to\l"
	.string "identify GHOSTS blocking your way.$"

EcruteakCity_Cave1_Text_Man_8::
	.string "The GHOSTBUSTER works properly!$"

EcruteakCity_Cave1_Text_Man_9::
	.string "Well, good luck on your KANTO’s\n"
	.string "adventure, {PLAYER}.$"
